      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>",
